        <description>&lt;img src="https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/icefield-hiking-in-urumqi/cover.jpg" alt="Featured image of post Icefield Hiking in Urumqi" /&gt;&lt;p&gt;My first time experiencing the snowfields of Xinjiang firsthand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All I can say is that the experience was absolutely incredible. It wasn&amp;rsquo;t nearly as cold as I had imagined; in fact, I actually felt quite hot (although the trail difficulty was relatively low). For the detailed video, please look out for my upcoming annual review.&lt;/p&gt;
